  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <div class=\"FoxDiv20250528104855896606\" style=\"text-align:center\"> \n  <div class=\"FoxDiv20250528104855896606\"> \n   <div style=\"padding:0px; text-align:justify; text-indent:28px\"> \n    <p class=\"vsbcontent_start\" style=\"padding:0px; text-indent:2em\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei UI\"\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures:normal\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"white-space:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration-thickness:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-style:initial\"><span style=\"text-decoration-color:initial\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"position:static !important\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"outline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"line-height:21px\"><span style=\"color:#555555\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\", 微软雅黑, \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", STHeiti, sans-serif\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"outline:0px\"><span style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span style=\"line-height:21px\"><span style=\"padding:0px; box-sizing:border-box; text-indent:2em\"><span style=\"outline:0px\"><span style=\"line-height:21px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, \"Microsoft YaHei\"\">East View斯大林数字化档案数据库源自俄罗斯国家社会与政治历史档案馆（Russian State Archive of Social and Political History，RGASPI）与耶鲁大学出版社（Yale University Press，YUP）的合作收藏项目，目前收录了28,000份文件，共计约380,000页的内容，包括斯大林的个人信件、阅读批注过的书籍、在任期间的官方文件及大量相关外交文献等。数据库还涵盖由耶鲁大学出版社出版的《共产主义编年史》（Annals of Communism, AOC）书目系列，共25卷。具有参考研究等学术价值。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n   </div> \n   <div style=\"padding:0px; text-align:justify; text-indent:28px\"> \n    <p style=\"padding:0px; text-inde